//    driven). Instantiated by axi_chiplet_controller, so it must be in the
//    fileset before it. USE_IDELAY=0 default → bit-exact passthrough, no
//    Xilinx primitive (this is what cocotb/iverilog/Verilator/VCS and the
//    ASIC flist take). The FPGA IP packaging sets USE_IDELAY=1 and defines
//    TIDELINK_USE_IDELAY. ──
